      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œLetâ€™s go!â€ Adora giggles, crawling forward before looking back, waiting for the girl. Sheâ€™s just staring at Adora though, and she canâ€™t tell why she isnâ€™t following, but her eyes widen a second later when she understands. â€œOh! Youâ€™re not supposed to follow strangersâ€¦...Iâ€™m Adora! Now we arenâ€™t strangers,â€ she giggles happily, the girl just staring, but she matches the sound Adoraâ€™s making after a second, laughing as best she can. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Adora and Catra, growing up in the Fright Zone together)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
